Start
  ^\s*A:admin@sr-2se-1-a# show chassis detail\s*$$
  ^\s*={79}$$
  ^\s*System Information\s*$$
  ^\s*={79}$$
  ^\s*Name\s*:\s*${NAME}\s*$$
  ^\s*Type\s*:\s*${TYPE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Chassis Topology\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_TOPOLOGY}\s*$$
