  ^\s*Number of slots\s*:\s*${NUMBER_OF_SLOTS}\s*$$
  ^\s*Oper number of slots\s*:\s*${OPER_NUMBER_OF_SLOTS}\s*$$
  ^\s*Num of faceplate ports/connectors\s*:\s*${NUM_FACEPLATE_PORTS}\s*$$
