  ^\s*Current alarm state\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_HW_CURRENT_ALARM_STATE}\s*$$
  ^\s*-{79}$$
  ^\s*Environment Information\s*$$
  ^\s*Number of fan trays\s*:\s*${NUM_FAN_TRAYS}\s*$$

ZeroOrMore
  ^\s*Fan tray number\s*:\s*${FAN_TRAY_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^\s*Speed\s*:\s*${FAN_SPEED}\s*$$
  ^\s*Status\s*:\s*${FAN_STATUS}\s*$$
