  ^\s*Current\s*:\s*${FAN_AMPERAGE_CURRENT}\s*Amps\s*$$
  ^\s*Peak\s*:\s*${FAN_AMPERAGE_PEAK}\s*Amps\s*\(${FAN_AMPERAGE_PEAK_DATE_TIME}\)\s*$$

  ^\s*-{79}$$
  ^\s*Power Management Information\s*$$
